# Many and few in Russian: много книг
subtitle: "Say a lot and too little in Russian with мно́го and ма́ло, and learn the of-many ending you already half know: кото́в, книг, люде́й."
teaches: ["grammar/of-ending"]
thumb: "band \"So many books, so little time\" note \"мно́го книг\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Years in Russian: в две тысячи двадцать пятом году","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/53-russian-years.cast"}

## Many and few in Russian: много книг
