    card title "Many and few"

A: How do you say a lot, or not much, in Russian?
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name parallel true

A: Tom is at Masha's, and there are books everywhere. First, just listen.
    draw o_books1

A: Ма́ша, у тебя́ мно́го книг!
    draw o_books2 caption false

B: Да, мно́го. А вре́мени ма́ло.
    draw o_books3 caption false

    ask "What does Masha say she has little of?" voice b options ["cats","water","time"] correct 3
        gloss: Yes, lots. But not much time.
        listen: Да, мно́го. А вре́мени ма́ло.
        right: Time: вре́мени ма́ло, not much time.

A: Мно́го is a lot; ма́ло is not much, or few: so many books, so little time.
    draw o_glass

    erase opening

    show speakers

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Not кни́ги, but книг: after мно́го, the book loses its ending.
    highlight talk_1_words part книг effect underline color #1a8a8a

B: And вре́мени is the word in ско́лько вре́мени?, lesson twenty-six.
    highlight talk_2_words part вре́мени effect underline color #1a8a8a

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Кото́в: cats after ско́лько, and after пять, end in ов.
    highlight talk_4_words part кото́в effect underline color #1a8a8a

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Five cats, and still ма́ло! But why ов on кото́в, when the book got no ending at all?
    highlight talk_4_words part кото́в effect underline color #1a8a8a

    erase talk

    hide speakers

A: You've used these endings for weeks: пять рубле́й, пять часо́в.
    draw k1 k2

A: After five to twenty, Russian counts in an of-many form.
    highlight k1 k2 effect underline color #8f887c

A: Мно́го, ма́ло and ско́лько work just like пять: the word after them takes that form.
    draw m_arrow m1 m2 m3

A: Grammar books call it the genitive plural: the of-ending of lesson twenty-eight, for many things.
    draw k_name

    erase boardA

A: Most he-words in a consonant add ов: кот, кото́в; стол, столо́в; just like час, часо́в.
    draw h1 r11 r12 r13

A: Words in а mostly drop it, and the ending is nothing: кни́га, книг; ма́ма, мам.
    draw h2 r21 r22

A: Оно́ words in о drop the о the same way: я́блоко, мно́го я́блок.
    draw r23

A: Words in a soft sign take ей: рубль, рубле́й.
    draw h3 r31

A: And лю́ди, people, is one to learn as it is: мно́го люде́й.
    draw r32 r32_tag

A: So: ов, nothing, or ей, and the word's last letter mostly tells you which.
    highlight h1 h2 h3 effect underline color #8f887c

    hide boardB

A: What you can't count stays one thing: мно́го воды́, as in нет воды́.
    draw c_water c1

B: Вре́мя — ма́ло вре́мени.
    draw c_glass c2

    erase boardC

B: Ско́лько люде́й?
    draw p1 p2 p3 p4 p5 d_q parallel true

A: В па́рке мно́го люде́й.
    draw d_a

    erase boardD

    draw q_cats parallel true

    quiz "Masha's cats: У Ма́ши мно́го ___. Which is right?" reveal.text "мно́го кото́в" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 280 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Six questions now, then your score.
        right: Кото́в: a he-word in a consonant adds ов.
        wrong: After мно́го comes the of-many form: which one ends like часо́в?
        * коты́
        + кото́в
        * кота́

    erase q_cats question_2_stamp

    draw q_books parallel true

    ask "Tom has lots of books too. Type the missing word: У То́ма мно́го ___." answer ["книг"] reveal.text "мно́го книг" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 280 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Книг: кни́га drops its а, and nothing takes its place.
        wrong: Start from кни́га, and take its last letter away.

    erase q_books question_3_stamp

    draw q_glass

    quiz "Masha is busy: У меня́ ма́ло ___. Which fills the gap?" reveal.text "ма́ло вре́мени" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 280 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Вре́мени: вре́мя can't be counted, so it stays one thing.
        wrong: Think of ско́лько вре́мени?
        + вре́мени
        * времена́
        * вре́мя

    erase q_glass question_4_stamp

    draw q_people parallel true

    quiz "In the park: Ско́лько ___? Which is right?" reveal.text "Ско́лько люде́й?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 280 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Люде́й: after ско́лько, лю́ди becomes люде́й.
        wrong: Лю́ди is the one to learn as it is: which form ends like рубле́й?
        * лю́ди
        * лю́дов
        + люде́й

    erase q_people question_5_stamp

    draw q_tom

    ask "Be Tom: Masha has five cats. Say his line." say_it "Пять? Э́то мно́го!" gloss "Five? That's a lot!" voice a show cue test t1
    voice a

A: Пять? Э́то мно́го!
    draw q_say

    erase q_tom q_say

    draw q_city

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: In Moscow there are a lot of people." answer ["В Москве много людей","В Москве очень много людей","Много людей в Москве"] reveal.text "В Москве́ мно́го люде́й." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 280 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: В Москве́ мно́го люде́й: в Москве́ for where, then мно́го and люде́й.
        wrong: Start with в Москве́, then a lot of people.

    erase q_city question_7_stamp

    draw score parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 5

    erase score

A: So after мно́го, ма́ло, ско́лько and пять, Russian counts in the of-many form,
    draw end_rule

A: with ов, with nothing, or with ей: кото́в, книг, люде́й.
    draw end_ex

B: Пять кото́в — э́то ма́ло!
    draw end_cat

    erase endboard end_cat

B: Next time, the big numbers: hundreds, thousands, and the year you were born. Пока́!
    box next53 "Next: lesson 53 · years" x 500 y 300 width 640 height 120 radius 14 font_size 44

